{
  "_comment": "1.21.1 line, fabric. fabric-api version is fabric_version in 1.21.1/gradle.properties. Launched through the checkout's own Gradle run task (gradle backend). jech and fabric-api carry via=dev-classpath (the loom run registers the fabric module's own sources and remaps modImplementation fabric-api onto the run's classpath); jei has no place on that classpath, so its jar is the one jar staged into mods/.",
